	"system": {
		"description": "<p>When you undertake a quest, you may extract an oath from an ally to aid you on your quest as a squire. The squire may ignore up to 2 levels of fatigue and gains expertise against Charm and Illusion spells so long as they are in pursuit of the quest.</p><p>If you fail, the quest ends for you both, and your squire also gains a level of strife.</p>",
